    "recommendations": "• Install a reflective address marker at the driveway entrance so responders can identify the property quickly from the road.\n• Keep the access drive clear of parked vehicles so emergency apparatus can reach the residence and detached structure without obstruction.\n• Trim vegetation along the access drive to maintain clear sightlines and overhead clearance for emergency vehicles.\n• Mark or unlock any gate controlling access to the rear of the property so responders can reach that area without delay.\n• Clear a path through dense vegetation between the main residence and the detached structure so responders can move between the two buildings on foot.\n• Keep the open lawn area free of stored equipment or materials so it can be used as a staging area for apparatus or personnel.\n• Thin dense vegetation near the detached structure so responders can work around all sides of the building."
